### Right-shifts this value by `bits` positions, copying the sign bit into vacated positions
### (arithmetic shift right). Shifting by 32 or more gives -1 for a negative value, else 0.
### :param bits: The number of bit positions to shift right.
### :returns: `me >> bits`.
routine S32.ashr(bits: Integer) -> S32
